      "source": "-- Quarantined candidate server combat script.\n-- Authoritative strike validation, dummy health, and hit token accounting are handled by project integration.\nlocal root = script.Parent\nlocal combatSystem = root:FindFirstChild(\"CombatSystem\")\nif not combatSystem then\n\treturn\nend\n",
